    "selection_rule": "Score all twenty-five candidates by leave-one-out median absolute log error over the 128 tokenized protocols with a usable market cap; among the specs inside a 5% tie band of the lowest, pick the highest forward hit rate on unique walk-forward rows (31 listed 2025-01-01 or later plus 12 listed 2024-07-01..2024-12-31, each scored once), then the fewest terms, then the lowest LOO. The gate is judged on interval high (rate + 1.6449xSE) against the money-place line, and the grade SE is effectively fixed at 12 matches, so interval-high order is expected-rate order. The pick is the pooled line shrunk 10% toward the fit-set mean (15/43 forward hits vs 10/43 pooled); its LOO median is 2.0% worse than pooled, inside noise. WF25/WF24 are therefore selection inputs for this pick, not blind validation of it; 5-fold, category-blind and WF26 stay blind.",
